                <divLine xml:id="m-a1a70860-6062-4832-868c-98690fbedd07" facs="#m-1960c0cc-ffb2-46de-8bc5-22e4195c5ffb" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-371c9580-82d1-4700-b45f-9eb15e51e91b">
              <lg xml:id="m-f8c844b2-19e5-41d4-980b-a224e46f691c">
                <l xml:id="m-0dd87dcc-33e6-43e9-acef-56dd7cce1a7c" facs="#m-7a184b0c-ef09-4be8-ab0c-c6a26de5073d" label="ambiguous">310</l><l xml:id="m-b569d8f6-5324-4e8e-a989-76b93879953a" facs="#m-8375a566-b657-4fdb-8576-3d9b89bc27e4" label="text-like">Ist Sunday of Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-a3a52fbf-b1b5-4df1-8b9f-16f0c89e2eb4" facs="#m-ed792b0e-93c8-4a5a-be9b-e0de67ce5252" label="lyrics-like">te exspé-ctant, non confun-déntur. Ps. Ví-as tú-as, Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-d3bb07ad-ce18-449c-8011-8b8d34355ff3" facs="#m-8a77bc8e-1e41-4349-8014-493407484632" label="lyrics-like">mine, demónstra mihi: * et sémi-tas tú-as édo-ce me¬</l><l xml:id="m-5ef737de-ec30-4de7-a7bb-e2d7bb2b99cc" facs="#m-32048b10-5673-4c18-aed3-cbb901acabe5" label="lyrics-like">Gló-ri- a Pátri. saccu- lórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-d768e726-7e33-40b9-afa0-fa0cffdb2a8f" facs="#m-54addfae-8711-4743-a723-e84f4e856ebd" label="lyrics-like">The Introit Ad te levávi. is repeated as far as the Psalm.</l><l xml:id="m-3626f012-7059-4fd8-961b-40f6b4ccc980" facs="#m-823ac859-bb0b-4212-b060-b43b3e13dfe0" label="text-like">This method of repeating the Introit is observed throughout the xear¬</l><l xml:id="m-73f08f69-9753-4fee-bf90-16b968d1784c" facs="#m-8ed6c676-957a-4ce6-8aa1-2f9dc509b964" label="lyrics-like">Glória in excélsis. is omitted from the Ist Sunday of Advent until Christmas.</l><l xml:id="m-9d1d2b41-7ffc-4918-9fb1-952092d4b32b" facs="#m-6339faf2-2be8-4cf6-9bb6-b362bd14b78a" label="text-like">except on Feasts.</l><l xml:id="m-b0481ff7-fe07-4416-8670-8b4b50e9e745" facs="#m-545eb21b-bf18-4ad6-8500-725da975b44c" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-b1d41e04-4b15-411c-80ca-61f67581c3b7" facs="#m-250b382c-d243-42d0-8407-206a63f62a7e" label="lyrics-like">Yxcita, quaesumus Dómine, pot-Qui vivis et regnas cum Deo Patre</l><l xml:id="m-7fd52200-4bda-4e73-9365-4320e83934c2" facs="#m-c01ae1b5-f248-4dc0-9af0-2bb1ac4dfe02" label="lyrics-like">Uéntiam tuam, et veni:t ut ab lin unitáte Spiritus Sancti Deus:</l><l xml:id="m-5770e14f-6631-4b91-adb4-95089765a19b" facs="#m-347be151-fa44-4b2a-a72a-11665cbb8c5d" label="lyrics-like">imminéntibus peccatórum nostró- per ómnia saécula saeculórum.</l><l xml:id="m-62a20772-e79a-4944-8e73-2cb94a521838" facs="#m-0f009275-c12c-4ed4-adb1-68b54c270893" label="ambiguous">R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-c935fc95-a97d-4088-be72-0ebae35529cd" facs="#m-e22e094b-6439-4c26-a1b8-6eb87608ff03" label="lyrics-like">rum periculis, te mereámur prote¬</l><l xml:id="m-a392092c-390c-4bd8-9177-6af0ce080780" facs="#m-f84c6adf-c343-444c-8456-d3d718afd4de" label="lyrics-like">génte éripi, te liberánte salvári.</l><l xml:id="m-91d3b0f6-1c6c-43d1-8efe-f32c713b74c9" facs="#m-ff8e7524-c927-43ef-9a5b-cd52b426ce8c" label="text-like">From the Ist Sundar of Advent to Christmas Eve, exclusive, aster the</l><l xml:id="m-66c12c88-c035-4e93-ba00-5bfcf4b8663f" facs="#m-ba9858db-9f3d-4eee-aee2-6da1d30c22a9" label="lyrics-like">Collect or the day. the Collect Deus qui de beâtae Mariae. is added wvith the</l><l xml:id="m-ac317ddd-dcf6-474a-ae2e-e178bd31d0c1" facs="#m-fe97e0ae-4bde-44ad-88eb-d92a1b872379" label="lyrics-like">Collect Ecclésiae tuac. or Deus ómnium fidélium. as below.</l><l xml:id="m-c2c495a2-e091-437d-baca-c1f168ea1d4a" facs="#m-497a2f4c-9934-45cc-bb83-b084f10b3c97" label="text-like">I however, there be a Commemoration of a Feast, the Collect of this</l><l xml:id="m-a9cb5db8-13f5-4391-ad8f-90b47559dd6e" facs="#m-aa9bc6ca-55e5-483c-9b7f-2d9e76a89646" label="text-like">Feast is said after the Collect of the day: and the Collect of Our Ladr is said</l><l xml:id="m-08606351-3722-4474-b883-7e9156c2c2a9" facs="#m-38700b50-9d78-4af2-aef3-06dc72497b96" label="text-like">thiraly. But the third Collect is omitied if the Feast commemorated be or</l><l xml:id="m-2e0ee6f5-aa20-4f75-88dc-b875741203cd" facs="#m-b0b41888-9446-4d96-a8ea-fcf0cf03ccbc" label="ambiguous">double rite.</l><l xml:id="m-3602ff93-4cae-41db-8d7b-c472bf740fd0" facs="#m-d582d477-6a88-4961-aab7-ee1a75e21026" label="text-like">of our Lady.</l><l xml:id="m-b88f1f3e-89f2-4181-a9ef-ead0a3dab6bd" facs="#m-ba04098e-0313-4610-aa8a-5f874a2fc614" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui de beátae Mariae Vir- tuis; ut, qui vere eam Genitricem</l><l xml:id="m-a7dbe2e0-f029-4719-885c-6e42e783379f" facs="#m-09328a27-5726-44c7-ad2e-1f7c81f2b002" label="lyrics-like">D ginis útero, Verbum tuum,</l><l xml:id="m-7eb9b9ca-0de2-4151-91cf-0f1f65b15618" facs="#m-74dc2d27-0371-4ac3-8c37-c1979d213f9d" label="lyrics-like">Dei crédimus, ejus apud te inter¬</l><l xml:id="m-21deff85-312c-4735-b267-b3745ba6105b" facs="#m-9071f887-82a2-4f26-83bd-400d2d1e76e3" label="lyrics-like">cessiónibus adjuvémur. (Per eúm¬</l><l xml:id="m-4da3ec83-fecf-4fa6-9024-b45441101c36" facs="#m-50714776-f512-4c59-8bea-79cac0918168" label="lyrics-like">Angelo nuntiánte, carnem suscí¬</l><l xml:id="m-91713914-45ec-46e8-a75f-8a1506106717" facs="#m-6c33349f-e6c7-4e6f-b0d2-bdcb53910847" label="lyrics-like">pere voluisti: praesta supplicibus! dem Dóminum.)</l><l xml:id="m-196d9fd3-253c-4180-bb72-5a02ee337561" facs="#m-a5d496cc-21b4-4988-9453-c8cd2013be9c" label="text-like">Against the persecutors of the Church.</l><l xml:id="m-8f9b3a6b-1358-44e4-9090-a6458ab3caae" facs="#m-0e580740-6867-4585-a562-19289d8f642c" label="lyrics-like">(Cclésiae tuae, quaésumus Dó-] ribus univérsis, secúra tibi sérviat</l><l xml:id="m-00523b8f-80f8-4293-ae4a-6f1823fcb45c" facs="#m-b641dcd7-f027-4c5f-9d86-fd1f7de4aefb" label="lyrics-like">C mine, preces placátus admitte:</l><l xml:id="m-ad7f633b-2394-4799-ad45-4fa0731dd9ba" facs="#m-d7adca07-1090-4834-97d6-d8f23427ce45" label="lyrics-like">libertáte. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-86cc0920-4b53-404f-87c2-04c0202f596d" facs="#m-b77d891a-b318-4527-968e-c97076315c7a" label="lyrics-like">ut destrúctis adversitátibus et erró¬</l><l xml:id="m-1326d4cd-c8b0-4637-bc03-0bb2ad617059" facs="#m-82d38cac-ed92-4008-9668-55aaf75117d0" label="text-like">or</l><l xml:id="m-aca0470c-a1c0-40b4-9b4d-b153725df545" facs="#m-e213a2a3-0147-4b00-a8dd-ccb419c1bac8" label="text-like">For the Pope.</l><l xml:id="m-d67ebb3a-ec0d-49d4-b839-9cfa602dbd66" facs="#m-4483a816-7485-4e69-aa87-d640a8b922a4" label="lyrics-like">Eus, ómnium fidélium pastor et quaésumus, verbo et exémplo, qui¬</l><l xml:id="m-fb3212f2-2445-4f03-9bae-b7cbca7e99ab" facs="#m-f12af407-b7ea-4677-8f09-e0b5a1601c1c" label="lyrics-like">U rector, fámulum tuum N. quem</l><l xml:id="m-dda20cca-cfe7-4d0b-89a9-d3e394531143" facs="#m-b5b01b1d-6b75-4c85-b70c-5988d10f7119" label="ambiguous">bus praeest, proficere; ut ad vitam,</l><l xml:id="m-60c7cb76-dff5-4f4a-af2a-17ba12cbc6e9" facs="#m-377186cf-ec03-4eec-a1d1-6de803f6e0a3" label="lyrics-like">pastórem Ecclésiae tuae pracésse</l><l xml:id="m-c48805f8-8fe2-4c83-851a-3d62f80ef59b" facs="#m-32c6d128-bc7b-46db-9a14-246f59bbed84" label="lyrics-like">una cum grege sibi crédito, pervé¬</l><l xml:id="m-2887ea72-c440-40bf-b02b-b16cfba2c4d8" facs="#m-49a269d4-05d8-47c0-971b-e9d858267ca3" label="lyrics-like">voluisti, propitius réspice: da ei, niat sempitérnam. Per Dóminum.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>